# Inherits the project configuration and relaxes two checks for tests only.
# Both relaxations are recorded in docs/DEVIATIONS.md.
#
# readability-magic-numbers (DEV-002): a test states its expected value as a
# literal on purpose. Naming every constant in an expectation table hides what
# the table is showing.
#
# cert-msc32-c / cert-msc51-cpp (DEV-003): AGENTS.md 8.5 requires every random
# source in a test to take an explicit seed, so a failure can be replayed. The
# check exists for unpredictability, which is the opposite of what a test needs.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -cert-msc32-c,
  -cert-msc51-cpp
